     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Gracias Paco por la info, ya la he colgado en la web (<a href=\"https://sevillarusers.wordpress.com/2017/03/01/jacaton-4-3-2017/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sevillarusers.wordpress.com/2017/03/01/jacaton-4-3-2017/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243351880000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1awi9Ss1GXXAAdsCv16Up2\">https://sevillarusers.wordpress.com/2017/03/01/jacaton-4-3-2017/</a>), animaros a venir aqunque no sepais mucho R, que sera divertido!</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div>Nacho</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
